  %section#why
    %h2 Why we made Pick-a-Pic
    %p
      “You’re a tech guy, can you figure out how to add a word to this app?”
    %p
      That was my introduction to AAC apps.
      It was also my first time hearing a story that has since become familiar, of frustrated parents giving up on those apps.
      Months later, when Selina taught me about PECS, it finally clicked for me: 
      this was the system that so many parents were trying to recreate with their AAC apps.
      Of course they were frustrated.
      The problem they were trying to solve did not fit the tool they were given to solve it.
    %p
      I asked Selina what the right tool would look like. That was the seed of Pick-a-Pic.
    %cite
      %span James
    %p TODO: SELINA

